 "<div class=\"rows\">\n      <div class=\"row hand\" data-hand=\"hers\"><span class=\"bit\">▪</span> <span class=\"bit\">▫</span> <span class=\"bit\">▫</span> <span class=\"bit\">▪</span> <span class=\"step\">becomes</span> <span class=\"bit\">▪</span> <span class=\"bit\">▫</span> <span class=\"bit\">▪</span> <span class=\"bit\">▫</span><span class=\"say\">the table I was handed. Counts the strip up by one</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row hand\" data-hand=\"hers\"><span class=\"bit\">▪</span> <span class=\"bit\">▫</span> <span class=\"bit\">▫</span> <span class=\"bit\">▪</span> <span class=\"step\">becomes</span> <span class=\"bit\">▫</span> <span class=\"bit\">▪</span> <span class=\"bit\">▪</span> <span class=\"bit\">▫</span><span class=\"say\">mine, and the plainest thing I could write. Turn every mark over</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row hand\" data-hand=\"hers\"><span class=\"bit\">▪</span> <span class=\"bit\">▫</span> <span class=\"bit\">▫</span> <span class=\"bit\">▪</span> <span class=\"step\">becomes</span> <span class=\"bit\">▫</span> <span class=\"bit\">▫</span> <span class=\"bit\">▫</span> <span class=\"bit\">▫</span><span class=\"say\">mine. Wipe it down to none, whatever it held</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row hand\" data-hand=\"hers\"><span class=\"bit\">▪</span> <span class=\"bit\">▫</span> <span class=\"bit\">▫</span> <span class=\"bit\">▪</span> <span class=\"step\">becomes</span> <span class=\"bit\">▪</span> <span class=\"bit\">▪</span> <span class=\"bit\">▪</span> <span class=\"bit\">▪</span><span class=\"say\">mine. Carry the first mark along and make the rest agree with it</span></div>\n    </div>"
